{"id":"48d4fc6774385f3f","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing5 Finite Support Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition — ZFC Forcing5 Finite Support Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition — ZFC Forcing5 Finite Support Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition — ZFC Forcing5 Finite Support Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,p,\\vec Q,\\vec 1\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,p,\\vec Q,\\vec 1\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5FiniteSupportCondition}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5FiniteSupportCondition}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5FiniteSupportCondition}_S(\\alpha,p,\\vec Q,\\vec 1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec Q,\\alpha,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\alpha,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec 1,\\alpha,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in\\alpha\\;(\\vec Q(\\xi)\\neq\\emptyset\\land p(\\xi)\\in\\vec Q(\\xi)\\land\\vec 1(\\xi)\\in\\vec Q(\\xi))\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{\\xi\\in\\alpha:p(\\xi)\\neq\\vec 1(\\xi)\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5FiniteSupportCondition}_S(\\alpha,p,\\vec Q,\\vec 1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec Q,\\alpha,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\alpha,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec 1,\\alpha,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in\\alpha\\;(\\vec Q(\\xi)\\neq\\emptyset\\land p(\\xi)\\in\\vec Q(\\xi)\\land\\vec 1(\\xi)\\in\\vec Q(\\xi))\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{\\xi\\in\\alpha:p(\\xi)\\neq\\vec 1(\\xi)\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The coordinate forcing family and its top-condition sequence are explicit parameters; support is the set of non-top coordinates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$, $\\mathrm{Function}$, and $\\mathrm{Finite}$ are as in [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], and [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$, $\\mathrm{Function}$, and $\\mathrm{Finite}$ are as in [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], and [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$, $\\mathrm{Function}$, and $\\mathrm{Finite}$ are as in [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], and [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,p,\\vec Q,\\vec 1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5FiniteSupportCondition}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5FiniteSupportCondition}_S(\\alpha,p,\\vec Q,\\vec 1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec Q,\\alpha,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\alpha,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec 1,\\alpha,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in\\alpha\\;(\\vec Q(\\xi)\\neq\\emptyset\\land p(\\xi)\\in\\vec Q(\\xi)\\land\\vec 1(\\xi)\\in\\vec Q(\\xi))\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{\\xi\\in\\alpha:p(\\xi)\\neq\\vec 1(\\xi)\\})","display":true}],"bytes":1516,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition.md|58-df-zfc-forcing5-finite-support-condition]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}